6c:T527,It may take up to 5 days to display your bonus points after they are issued. You must claim your points after they are issued.<br></br><br></br>Set Bing as your default search engine by doing one of the following for the web browser that you use most frequently:<br></br><br></br><semibold>On Microsoft Edge:</semibold><ul><li>Go to Settings.</li><li>Search for “search engine” in the “Search settings” box</li><li>Click on “Search and connected experiences”, and then on “Address bar and search”.</li><li>Choose Bing in the dropdown against “Search engine used in the address bar”.</li></ul><br></br><semibold>On Google Chrome:</semibold><ul><li>Go to Settings.</li><li>Click the “Search engine” tab.</li><li>Click “Change” button under Search Engine and select “Microsoft Bing”.</li></ul><br></br><semibold>On your mobile device:</semibold><ul><li>Go to Settings.</li><li>Search for the word “search”.</li><li>Change the provider to Bing/Microsoft Bing under the address bar search settings.</li></ul><br></br>Once you have changed your default search engine, search through the address bar in your browser for {daysMax, number} days in the calendar month to complete the bonus requirements.<br></br><br></br>Bonus is awarded ready to claim at the start of the next calendar month.
