><br></br>Tips to help you gain more points:<ul><li>Keep and use Bing as your default search engine throughout the month.</li><li>Follow the Rewards Program policies and guidelines.</li><li>Earn points by using Bing for genuine search needs only.</li><li>Avoid unnatural methods for earning or abusing the program.</li><li><about-link>Learn about how to get the most out of Microsoft Rewards.</about-link></li><li><limits-link>Learn about search or earning limitations.</limits-link></li></ul><br></br>Note: It may take up to 5 days to display your bonus points after they are issued. You must claim your points after they are issued.","legendPointsRange":"{min, number} - {max, number} points","programEarningDescription":"Join the Rewards members earning Star bonus points","programEarningsLastMonth":"Program earnings last month","title":"Bing Star bonus"}},"Dashboard":{"HeroCarousel":{"nextSlide":"Next slide","previousSlide":"Previous slide","slideIndicator":"Slide {current, number} of {total, number}"}}},"children":"$L6d"}]

